{"source": "tts:kokoro:af_heart", "precision": "tts", "offset": 0, "duration": 86.008, "sentences": [{"text": "Every byte that leaves this stack is written down before it can leave.", "start": 0, "end": 3.65}, {"text": "The data-flow disclosure lists each flow: where it goes, what it carries, what it never carries, and how to switch it off.", "start": 3.9, "end": 10.527}, {"text": "And the build enforces it: a service without a row is refused.", "start": 10.778, "end": 14.441}, {"text": "When you talk to the twin, what leaves your device?", "start": 14.691, "end": 17.148}, {"text": "Your typed words, the last few turns, and the address and browser every request carries.", "start": 17.398, "end": 22.559}, {"text": "Never audio, the avatar, a cookie, or any identifier of the visit or the visitor.", "start": 22.81, "end": 28.079}, {"text": "And in production, no one's words land in any log, trace, or store.", "start": 28.329, "end": 32.211}, {"text": "When the paid fallback answers, your words go to Anthropic.", "start": 32.461, "end": 35.716}, {"text": "In Hareet's words: this site saves none of it, and Anthropic may keep a turn it answered for up to thirty days, never for training.", "start": 35.966, "end": 43.487}, {"text": "Then, what the twin says back.", "start": 43.737, "end": 45.334}, {"text": "It answers only from what Hareet wrote, and when that doesn't hold the answer, it says: \"I don't know yet.\"", "start": 45.583, "end": 51.17}, {"text": "Before any word leaves the gateway, code checks the answer against its sources: numbers, amounts, ownership, privacy.", "start": 51.42, "end": 58.568}, {"text": "A failed check withholds the answer.", "start": 58.818, "end": 60.585}, {"text": "And every change is tested: a hundred and eighty-six cases drawn from the corpus, graded by code, never by another model.", "start": 60.835, "end": 68.633}, {"text": "Every data flow disclosed.", "start": 68.883, "end": 70.509}, {"text": "Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.", "s